Z||000002||rogergarrison||01-31-2001||09:08 AM||||just dont do like everyone and leave it on all the time. clearcoat (and others) will haze up, like mildew under the bra if you leave it on wet for long times. If you dont get it tite, wind will make it cut into sharp edges of body and paint too. Bras are really for protecting on a long trip, road racing-not everyday. I cant count the number of cars ive repainted the front half of from Hondas to Vettes. Also know a lot of people use them to cover up damage so they dont have to fix it.<P>my 2 cents||||reg||1
